      <Prose><strong>Your report should include:</strong> the differential equation and data; mesh coordinates and unknown meanings; the stencil or weak form; boundary elimination; matrix normalization; solver and finite stopping rule; residual evaluation; reconstruction; the norm and complete error budget; and any reference or refinement evidence. If the budget is exhausted, say that and retain the unmet bound. Do not relabel a plausible plot as a certificate.</Prose>
